    W1T["hh-dataplatform-test<br/><i>(TEST - Data engineering for every domain)</i><br/>Admin: fabric-admins · Contributor: data-engineers<br/>Contributor: svc-dataflows-nonprod (service account only)"]:::test
    W1P["hh-dataplatform-prod<br/><i>(PROD - Data engineering for every domain)</i><br/>Admin: fabric-admins · Viewer: data-engineers<br/>Contributor: svc-dataflows-prod (runs the Dataflow; no people)"]:::prod
